    title: "Case Studies: Evidence in Action",
    subtitle: "What real, documented incidents prove about Agentic AI in offense and defense",
    color: palette.blue,
    intro: "The playbook's thesis isn't theoretical: it rests on documented, public cases from 2025 - 2026. These mini case studies translate the sources cited throughout the playbook into 'what happened and what it proves.' Each is drawn from primary reporting; tap to expand. (Figures are as reported by the cited source; verify before quoting in formal settings.)",
